    intended to represent some of the major television stories of 2026,
    rather than establish a definitive ranking.
  </p>


  <div class="show">
    <strong>1. Stranger Things</strong>
    <p>
      Even after its finale, Netflix's science-fiction phenomenon remained
      one of the defining television shows of the year. Its enormous
      existing audience continued to watch the series after its conclusion.
    </p>
    <p class="stat">
